swimlane Insurance Claim Handling
lane Customer Service Representative orange
  (Customer reports a loss by phone, web form or branch visit)
    -> Record the loss details and confirm the policy number with the caller
  Record the loss details and confirm the policy number with the caller
    -> <Is the reported loss covered under the policy as written?>
lane Claims Adjuster blue
  <Is the reported loss covered under the policy as written?>
    -yes, the peril and the property are both listed in the schedule-> Inspect the property and photograph every damaged item
    -no, the peril is excluded or the policy had lapsed-> Send the written denial letter with appeal instructions
  Inspect the property and photograph every damaged item
    -> Estimate the repair cost using the regional contractor price list
  Estimate the repair cost using the regional contractor price list
    -> <Does the estimate exceed the adjuster's settlement authority?>
  <Does the estimate exceed the adjuster's settlement authority?>
    -estimate is above the 25,000 authority limit-> Escalate the file to the senior claims committee for review
    -estimate is within the limit-> Issue the settlement offer to the policyholder
lane Senior Claims Committee purple
  Escalate the file to the senior claims committee for review
    -> Approve, reduce or reject the settlement at the weekly committee meeting
  Approve, reduce or reject the settlement at the weekly committee meeting
    -approved without changes-> Issue the settlement offer to the policyholder
lane Finance and Payments green
  Issue the settlement offer to the policyholder
    -> Release the payment to the policyholder or the repair contractor
  Release the payment to the policyholder or the repair contractor
    -> (Claim closed and archived) success
  Send the written denial letter with appeal instructions
    -> (Claim closed without payment) terminate
